# Allowlist: dist/ (Netlify publish target) plus the source build tooling. content/ stays local, never committed.

*

!.gitignore
!netlify.toml
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!dist/
!dist/**

# Source build tooling (versioned for recovery; no secrets in these)
!build_static_site.py
!build_bibliography_md.py
!garden-compose.css
!config.yml
!watch_and_build.ps1
!run_build_scheduled.bat
!serve.py

# Guidance and open work. These held only on the laptop until 31 August 2026,
# which made the repo's own instructions the one thing a rebuild could not
# recover. They carry no secrets: build_bibliography_md.py names ZOTERO_API_KEY
# and reads it from a .env that stays ignored.
!CLAUDE.md
!_role.md
!*xkTODO*.md
!*xkWAITING*.md
!*xkLATER*.md

# Build output copies of trash / local junk — never ship
**/desktop.ini
dist/.trash/
dist/assets/md_hashes.json
dist/site.pdf
!analytics_pull.py
